        "text": "### Result\n\"[\\\"Edge from prog-lang to code-review\\\",\\\"Edge from prog-lang to sys-design\\\",\\\"Edge from problem-solve to sys-design\\\",\\\"Edge from collab to code-review\\\",\\\"Edge from agile to collab\\\"]\"\n### Ran Playwright code\n```js\nawait page.evaluate('() => {\\n  const progLang = document.querySelector(\\'[data-id=\"prog-lang\"]\\');\\n  const agile = document.querySelector(\\'[data-id=\"agile\"]\\');\\n  const source = progLang.querySelector(\\'.react-flow__handle-bottom\\');\\n  const target = agile.querySelector(\\'.react-flow__handle-top\\');\\n  const r1 = source.getBoundingClientRect();\\n  const r2 = target.getBoundingClientRect();\\n  const cx1 = r1.x + r1.width/2, cy1 = r1.y + r1.height/2;\\n  const cx2 = r2.x + r2.width/2, cy2 = r2.y + r2.height/2;\\n\\n  function fire(el, type, x, y) {\\n    const ev = new PointerEvent(type, {bubbles:true, cancelable:true, composed:true, clientX:x, clientY:y, pointerId:1, isPrimary:true, button:0, buttons:1});\\n    el.dispatchEvent(ev);\\n  }\\n  fire(source, \\'pointerdown\\', cx1, cy1);\\n  // simulate intermediate moves\\n  const steps = 5;\\n  for (let i=1;i<=steps;i++) {\\n    const x = cx1 + (cx2-cx1)*i/steps;\\n    const y = cy1 + (cy2-cy1)*i/steps;\\n    fire(document, \\'pointermove\\', x, y);\\n  }\\n  fire(target, \\'pointerup\\', cx2, cy2);\\n  fire(document, \\'pointerup\\', cx2, cy2);\\n  const edges = document.querySelectorAll(\\'.react-flow__edge\\');\\n  return JSON.stringify(Array.from(edges).map(e => e.getAttribute(\\'aria-label\\')));\\n}');\n```"
